      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "传送机器人在死亡重启的Crashloop中挑战擂台",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You are Blink, a teleporting robot who is the newest “looprunner” gladiator to compete in the Crashloop, a deadly roguelike tournament to the death. Die and reawaken in an endless loop, leap over lava pools, avoid turret fire, and take down waves of enemy defendroids. Battle your fellow looprunners for a chance to fight the Captain in the Hyperdome, and claim his power for yourself!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401230/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "夺取并升级Turbofist组合火焰、飞镖与时间控制",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Defeat other looprunners to claim their Turbofists! Shoot flames, launch shurikens, slow time, summon zombies and more! Upgrade the turbofists with power from other defeated looprunners to become unstoppable.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401230/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
